  <Docs>
    <summary>Records drawing commands for a <see cref="T:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext" /> into recordings that can later be inserted and submitted to the GPU.</summary>
    <remarks><![CDATA[
## Remarks

Create a recorder from a <see cref="T:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext" />, draw into surfaces that target the recorder, call <see cref="T:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecorder" />.<c>Snap</c> to capture a <see cref="T:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecording" />, and dispose the recorder when it is no longer needed.
    ]]></remarks>
  </Docs>
